// seeds, architecture, optimiser and splits, and keeps the trajectory instead
// of only its endpoints. Evaluated every 5 epochs, averaged over 5 seeds,
// then thinned (every point up to epoch 200, then every 100th) for the figure.
//
// Reconciliation with the numbers the pages publish, which come from
